<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">Chollima on the Wing</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as 천리마 달린다, Chollima dallinda</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">&quot;Chollima on the Wing&quot; is a North Korean song made to stir popular support for the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chollima-movement">Chollima Movement</a>, the state's first and best-known mass mobilisation campaign. The Chollima of its title is the winged horse of East Asian legend, the qianlima of the Chinese classics, said to be too swift to be ridden by any mortal and named for its ability to cover a thousand li in a single day.</p></div>
